# Public endpoint only; no API keys or recipient email in this value.
# Create the form in the owner's Formspree account, set and verify
# official@drawnoutdigital.com as recipient, then copy its /f/ endpoint here.
# Leave empty until that setup is complete. Never use a guessed form ID.
# Astro reads this at build time; rebuild after changing it.
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
